# --- Pixi lockfile ---
#   GitHub display settings & conflict handling for the generated lockfile
#
# merge=binary:             Report conflicting changes instead of merging file contents.
# linguist-language=YAML:   Use YAML syntax highlighting on GitHub.
# linguist-generated=true:  Collapse GitHub diffs by default and exclude from language statistics.
# -diff:                    Treat the file as binary for Git diffs, suppressing textual patches.
pixi.lock merge=binary linguist-language=YAML linguist-generated=true -diff